          "[Updated May 2026] Settings locations may differ depending on which iPhone model and\niOS version the patron has.",
          "If a patron forgets their Apple ID password, they can reset it at iforgot.apple.com\nor on the device through Settings.",
          "[Updated May 2026] On newer iPhones, Control Center opens by swiping down from the\ntop-right corner of the screen.",
          "[Updated May 2026] To turn on Do Not Disturb: open Control Center, tap the Focus\nbutton, then choose Do Not Disturb.",
          "[Updated 2019] To take a screenshot, press the side button and the volume up button\nat the same time. To force an app to close, press the Home button twice quickly.",
          "[Updated May 2026] The library's 3D printer is available to patrons for 10 cents per\ngram of filament. Reserve time at the front desk."
